cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "QuakeTriage: agentic post-earthquake building damage assessment and rescue prioritization"
type: software
authors:
  # TODO(the project owner): add family-names (and ORCID if you have one).
  - given-names: "the project owner"
    alias: "Kuipyy"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kuipyy/quake-triage-agent"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype that detects building damage from pre/post-earthquake satellite imagery,
  quantifies uncertainty, prioritizes sites with TOPSIS, plans team routes with OR-Tools and grounds
  protocol advice in AFAD TAMP and INSARAG guidelines. Not validated for operational use.
keywords:
  - earthquake
  - damage assessment
  - change detection
  - search and rescue
  - decision support
  - LLM agent
